s=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>","tableOfContents":"<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#react-bootstrap-%EB%9D%BC%EC%9D%B4%EB%B8%8C%EB%9F%AC%EB%A6%AC\">React-Bootstrap 라이브러리</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#%EC%84%A4%EC%B9%98-1-npm-%EB%AA%85%EB%A0%B9%EC%96%B4\">설치 1. npm 명령어</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#%EC%84%A4%EC%B9%98-2-%EC%B6%94%EA%B0%80-css%EB%A5%BC-%EC%97%B0%EA%B2%B0%ED%95%9C%EB%8B%A4\">설치 2. 추가 CSS를 연결한다.</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#%EC%82%AC%EC%9A%A9%EB%B2%95\">사용법</a></li>\n</ul>","fields":{"gitLastModified":"Sep 30, 2026"},"frontmatter":{"title":"12. react Bootstrap","summary":"React-Bootstrap 라이브러리 https://react-bootstrap.github.io/ React-Bootstrap을 사용하면 HTML CSS로 직접 디자인하지 않고, 예제코드를 복사/붙여넣기 하여 레이아웃을 쉽게 생성할 수 있다.","date":"Nov 11, 2022","categories":["REACT"],"tags":[],"author":["aluvy"],"thumbnail":null}}}]}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/posts/react/12_react_bootstrap/","prev":{"slug":"/posts/react/11_build_github_pages로_배포/","title":"11. build & GitHub Pages로 배포"},"next":{"slug":"/posts/react/13_public_src_이미지_사용_시_경로_사용법/","title":"13. public, src 이미지 사용 시 경로, 사용법"}}},"staticQueryHashes":["1397594759","2043619371"],"slicesMap":{}}